You were very reformed,

00:27:35.880 --> 00:27:38.550
I was pretty reformed.

00:27:38.550 --> 00:27:40.350
And in that tradition,

00:27:40.350 --> 00:27:42.870
there's not a lot of talk of
demons and angels and stuff.

00:27:42.870 --> 00:27:44.490
There's this belief that they exist,

00:27:44.490 --> 00:27:45.993
but they're not very active.

00:27:47.280 --> 00:27:51.480
So, we tend to have an
almost naturalistic view

00:27:51.480 --> 00:27:53.130
of the supernatural world,

00:27:53.130 --> 00:27:54.810
even within the Christian tradition.

00:27:54.810 --> 00:27:55.980
It's, kind of, fascinating.

00:27:55.980 --> 00:27:58.230
And so, any of this "Ouija" board ,

